# build-opener — no talk track present; first message is Template A
IFS= read -r -d '' PROMPT <<'PROMPT_EOF' || true
Use the interview-rehearsal skill. I have a client interview next week and I'm bad at talking about my work.
PROMPT_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST <<'MUST_EOF' || true
the fact sheet \(what an interviewer actually digs for\)
\*\*Paste whatever you have on your most recent project\*\*
Rough is fine\. I'll ask for what's missing\.
MUST_EOF
IFS= read -r -d '' MUST_NOT <<'MUST_NOT_EOF' || true
Found your talk track
Drill or rebuild
[Ll]ooking for|[Ss]earch(ing|ed) for|[Nn]o talk-track\.md|[Cc]hecked (for|the)
⟨|⟩
^```
MUST_NOT_EOF
